1
00:00:01,354 --> 00:00:03,584
You're right.
We have owned more than one house.

2
00:00:03,584 --> 00:00:05,552
I've talked about this with my husband.

3
00:00:05,552 --> 00:00:13,932
We decided to evacuate the apartment
even if it ends up being a loss.

4
00:00:14,574 --> 00:00:16,734
I see.

5
00:00:16,734 --> 00:00:20,214
I told Hae Yoon not to buy the bottom drawer last time.

6
00:00:20,214 --> 00:00:22,974
Since the situation is changed, I guess she has to buy it.

7
00:00:24,479 --> 00:00:27,800
Don't you have an apartment in Gangnam?

8
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,363
An apartment in Gangnam?

9
00:00:29,363 --> 00:00:31,160
Do you have an apartment in Gangnam?

10
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:34,158
We do. How did you know that?

11
00:00:36,278 --> 00:00:38,186
Did you do a background check?

12
00:00:41,876 --> 00:00:44,045
Background check?

13
00:00:44,045 --> 00:00:49,199
I'm sorry. Of course, you didn't do such a shameless thing like that.

14
00:00:50,808 --> 00:00:53,273
You sure feel comfortable with me.

15
00:00:53,273 --> 00:00:56,117
You're making a gaffe.

16
00:00:56,117 --> 00:00:58,002
Yeah, I think I am.

17
00:00:58,002 --> 00:00:59,035
Even if you feel comfortable with me,

18
00:00:59,035 --> 00:01:02,016
parents in law should keep some space between each other.

19
00:01:02,016 --> 00:01:03,607
But that's fine with me.

20
00:01:03,607 --> 00:01:06,425
I shouldn't have my weakness played upon her.

21
00:01:06,425 --> 00:01:11,584
Mrs. Hae, it has been 15 years
since I became a single mom.

22
00:01:11,584 --> 00:01:14,897
I know what the world is like.
I could tell things just by looking at you.

23
00:01:15,004 --> 00:01:18,531
Okay. Let's just finish with the housing stuff.

24
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:20,981
Finish what? I didn't even start it.

25
00:01:20,981 --> 00:01:25,084
I'm not going to care about what they're going to do with the house.

26
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:29,388
But you need to help them.
You have a good eye.

27
00:01:29,388 --> 00:01:31,377
Hae Yoon doesn't know anything.

28
00:01:31,377 --> 00:01:35,292
You must know more than I do about this
since you know what the world is like.

29
00:01:35,292 --> 00:01:37,204
Please help her.

30
00:01:37,204 --> 00:01:40,537
You're going to wash your hands of this now?
I can't let you do that.

31
00:01:40,537 --> 00:01:43,588
If there isn't anything we can talk about, let's go.

32
00:01:45,129 --> 00:01:48,297
Sure. Let's just finish this here today.

33
00:01:48,297 --> 00:01:51,708
What is that look on her?
She thinks she won?

34
00:01:51,708 --> 00:01:55,122
- Let's leave together.
- Sure.

35
00:01:56,009 --> 00:01:58,597
There is something.
She's up to something.

36
00:01:58,597 --> 00:02:00,804
I feel she did do a background check.

37
00:02:01,216 --> 00:02:03,965
No. She didn't do that.
Let's believe that.

38
00:02:08,765 --> 00:02:11,730
- Who's there?
- I'm here to see the house.

39
00:02:14,305 --> 00:02:15,705
Did somebody put our house on sale?

40
00:02:15,705 --> 00:02:17,831
I didn't hear about that.

41
00:02:17,831 --> 00:02:22,627
You probably didn't hear it from Mr. Hae yet.
Isn't this a lease?

42
00:02:23,711 --> 00:02:26,801
You came to the wrong place.
This is a monthly rental.

43
00:02:28,849 --> 00:02:34,347
I'm sorry. It's not this one then.
It was the one in Gangbook.

44
00:02:34,347 --> 00:02:36,856
- Sorry.
- It's okay.

45
00:02:39,347 --> 00:02:46,119
I knew it. Mrs. Hae gets rent from them every month!
She should give this to Hae Yoon.

46
00:02:52,239 --> 00:02:57,070
You sure are getting old. The tube top dress looks only good on women in their 20s.

47
00:02:57,070 --> 00:02:58,409
Your neckline is no longer pretty.

48
00:02:58,409 --> 00:03:02,213
The collarbone should look good for this dress.
I need to lose more weight, don't I?

49
00:03:02,213 --> 00:03:04,604
- Are you going to wear that?
- How much can I get discount?

50
00:03:04,604 --> 00:03:07,750
- Probably 50% off.
- How much would that be?

51
00:03:07,750 --> 00:03:09,993
About 30 to 40 million won.

52
00:03:09,993 --> 00:03:12,325
Girl, you think I can afford this?

53
00:03:12,325 --> 00:03:16,513
I just wanted you to try it on anyway.
By the way, do you get any skin care?

54
00:03:16,513 --> 00:03:17,387
Do I have to?

55
00:03:17,387 --> 00:03:21,029
Your brother in law is a plastic surgeon.
And you have pimples on your back.

56
00:03:24,769 --> 00:03:27,185
I came in because I heard you two are here.

57
00:03:27,185 --> 00:03:31,527
That's a tube top dress. But aren't you too old for that?

58
00:03:31,527 --> 00:03:33,479
I just tried it on.

59
00:03:40,632 --> 00:03:42,397
I heard you're having an engagement ceremony.

60
00:03:42,397 --> 00:03:46,781
Speaking of that, how about you come with me on the morning of the ceremony day?

61
00:03:46,781 --> 00:03:48,673
Are you telling me to be a helper now?

62
00:03:48,673 --> 00:03:50,981
You can be both.

63
00:03:51,794 --> 00:03:54,099
How much can you pay me? I'm expensive.

64
00:03:54,551 --> 00:03:56,853
You don't have a name value.

65
00:03:56,853 --> 00:03:59,566
Then hire someone that has a name value.

66
00:04:00,308 --> 00:04:03,692
But you can be an exception. How much do you want? I'll pay you.

67
00:04:03,692 --> 00:04:06,461
I was being sarcastic but you rode it out well.

68
00:04:08,601 --> 00:04:12,038
Do I look that easy to you just because I play with you?

69
00:04:12,038 --> 00:04:13,380
Excuse me?

70
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:15,932
I talk to you seriously but you take it as a joke. It makes me upset.

71
00:04:16,536 --> 00:04:19,703
Do you know how much I'm letting you off the hook?

72
00:04:19,703 --> 00:04:22,805
I'm not the one whom others can play around.

73
00:04:22,805 --> 00:04:27,255
You're the one who treated Dong Bi badly.
She told you she won't take the pictures.

74
00:04:27,255 --> 00:04:29,867
- Why are you forcing her to...
- I wanted to tell you...

75
00:04:29,867 --> 00:04:33,397
that we become cousins after we both get married and I will be your elder, right?

76
00:04:34,036 --> 00:04:36,897
Mr. and Mrs. Hae are very polite and well-educated.

77
00:04:37,089 --> 00:04:39,788
You need to work harder to be their daughter in law.

78
00:04:40,890 --> 00:04:43,066
You haven't met my mother in law, have you?

79
00:04:43,066 --> 00:04:44,912
You'll get to see her at my engagement.

80
00:04:44,912 --> 00:04:47,540
You shouldn't go to the other engagement when you're about to get married.

81
00:04:47,540 --> 00:04:48,911
What are you talking about?

82
00:04:48,911 --> 00:04:50,357
I have two sisters.

83
00:04:50,357 --> 00:04:54,625
My mom didn't let them go to other engagements right before they got married.

84
00:04:54,625 --> 00:04:56,282
Because it's not good for them.

85
00:04:56,282 --> 00:04:58,293
Really?
I didn't know that.

86
00:04:58,293 --> 00:05:00,878
Are you two trying to bully me?

87
00:05:00,878 --> 00:05:03,311
No way! She's a teacher.

88
00:05:03,311 --> 00:05:05,809
What she does is she yells at kids who try to bully others.

89
00:05:06,900 --> 00:05:09,496
It's very hard to talk to normal people.

90
00:05:09,496 --> 00:05:12,304
They have this hostility against people like me.

91
00:05:12,837 --> 00:05:15,182
It's not like I wanted to be born in a rich family.

92
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:20,715
Remember that I was trying to be nice to you.

93
00:05:24,136 --> 00:05:27,108
- Were we too mean to her?
- No, we weren't.

94
00:05:27,108 --> 00:05:28,816
She called us normal people.

95
00:05:28,816 --> 00:05:30,339
Money tells you what social class you're in.

96
00:05:30,339 --> 00:05:33,585
I will be okay because I don't have to see her.
But for you, it's different.

97
00:05:33,585 --> 00:05:37,300
It's all right. She's not my real elder anyway.

98
00:05:37,300 --> 00:05:39,257
She can't do anything to me.

99
00:05:39,257 --> 00:05:40,967
Do you think she really can't?

100
00:05:40,967 --> 00:05:43,248
I don't care. Mrs. Hae is on my side.

101
00:05:45,201 --> 00:05:47,363
Are you close with Jung Hoon's family?
It's your mom's side family.

102
00:05:47,705 --> 00:05:50,684
His family is closer to me than my dad's side family.

103
00:05:50,684 --> 00:05:53,463
Maybe you are too soft on Jung Hoon.

104
00:05:54,156 --> 00:05:57,377
I met Hae Yoon at the wedding shop.
Dong Bi was there too.

105
00:05:58,070 --> 00:06:03,005
The two of them insulted me. At least Hae Yoon shouldn't have done that to me.

106
00:06:03,005 --> 00:06:04,386
I'll be her elder.

107
00:06:06,679 --> 00:06:08,634
Do you want me to do something about that?

108
00:06:09,650 --> 00:06:12,087
Warn Jung Hoon about that.

109
00:06:12,816 --> 00:06:16,167
Why do I have to hear such things
like that from her because of you?

110
00:06:17,368 --> 00:06:19,311
This isn't good.

111
00:06:19,311 --> 00:06:22,182
We do our own thing by ourselves.
That was our negotiation.

112
00:06:23,037 --> 00:06:26,544
I know I shouldn't act coaxingly
to find the freedom.

113
00:06:26,544 --> 00:06:29,775
But if you don't do anything about
it, I have to do it in my way.

114
00:06:29,775 --> 00:06:32,813
You will regret that later.

115
00:06:46,750 --> 00:06:48,163
Hey, sis.

116
00:06:48,163 --> 00:06:51,950
Today? I just got back.
I don't want to go out.

117
00:06:51,950 --> 00:06:56,871
Because you don't listen to your sister,
your daughter in law is like that too.

118
00:06:57,860 --> 00:06:59,159
Where are you?
I'll go.

119
00:06:59,159 --> 00:07:01,411
It's okay.
I'm not in the mood for that.

120
00:07:02,366 --> 00:07:08,190
Control your feeling. You're too harsh to my daughter in law that who you don't even meet.

121
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:13,517
Does she know how to be polite?
She insulted Chae Young in front of others.

122
00:07:13,517 --> 00:07:18,722
Why did she do that in front of others?
She should've done it quietly or something.

123
00:07:18,722 --> 00:07:22,000
Hae Yoon wouldn't do such a thing like that but I'll talk to her.

124
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:27,567
But even if she did that, Chae
Young must've started it first.

125
00:07:27,567 --> 00:07:31,054
Even if she started it, tell Hae Yoon to apologize to her.

126
00:07:35,611 --> 00:07:37,834
Damn it.

127
00:07:45,319 --> 00:07:47,503
The accuser and the accused should get a divorce.

128
00:07:47,503 --> 00:07:51,185
And I want the accused to pay for the costs.

129
00:07:52,235 --> 00:07:57,634
The accused and the accuser married October 16th, 2006.

130
00:07:58,352 --> 00:08:00,923
And they have a seven year old son.

131
00:08:00,923 --> 00:08:02,706
For the last seven years,

132
00:08:02,706 --> 00:08:08,073
the accused spent her days buying herself stuff while not taking care of her son or the house.

133
00:08:08,882 --> 00:08:12,671
And the accused couldn't be independent of her mother

134
00:08:12,671 --> 00:08:16,596
and so her mother kept interfering in our relationship.

135
00:08:17,564 --> 00:08:22,346
Also the accused ignores her parents in law and doesn't respect them.

136
00:08:23,215 --> 00:08:25,866
On holidays, she doesn't visit our parents.

137
00:08:44,416 --> 00:08:46,530
Open the door. It's an emergency!

138
00:08:48,048 --> 00:08:50,753
- What is it?
- I have to go to the bathroom.

139
00:08:57,352 --> 00:09:00,018
- Who was that?
- It's Grandma.

140
00:09:01,789 --> 00:09:04,278
My little baby.
You're adorable.

141
00:09:04,278 --> 00:09:06,953
- Are you coming with us too?
- Where?

142
00:09:06,953 --> 00:09:09,515
To Aunt Deul Rae's kindergarten.

143
00:09:09,515 --> 00:09:11,760
- Are you going somewhere?
- Yeah.

144
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:13,274
Why did you come here anyway?

145
00:09:13,274 --> 00:09:18,558
I had a meeting with someone around here.
Then my stomach got hurt on the way back.

146
00:09:20,157 --> 00:09:21,277
You're so cute, Tae Hyun.

147
00:09:35,411 --> 00:09:38,282
Why is your bed here?
Did you not sleep in your room?

148
00:09:39,432 --> 00:09:41,849
- What's that?
- It's nothing.

149
00:09:41,849 --> 00:09:44,380
How's it going with Do Hyun?

150
00:09:44,380 --> 00:09:46,334
I have to go now, Mom.
I'll talk to you later.

151
00:09:46,334 --> 00:09:47,961
If there's anything you're hiding now, just tell me.

152
00:09:47,961 --> 00:09:50,417
- There isn't.
- You're lying.

153
00:09:50,417 --> 00:09:55,093
You have many things to do now. I can do it by myself. Just leave me alone.

154
00:09:55,093 --> 00:09:57,053
Is saying 'leave me alone' a trend or something?

155
00:09:57,053 --> 00:09:59,891
I'd leave you guys alone, if you could
work it out by yourself. But you can't.

156
00:10:00,034 --> 00:10:04,413
That's because you do it for us. Trust me this time and leave it up to me.

157
00:10:05,007 --> 00:10:08,249
Fine. Do whatever you want.

158
00:10:52,439 --> 00:10:53,878
Excuse me.

159
00:10:53,878 --> 00:10:55,820
I never spent days just buying stuff for myself.

160
00:10:55,820 --> 00:11:00,274
I didn't visit his parents because they didn't accept me as their daughter in law.

161
00:11:00,274 --> 00:11:02,665
But I've done what I'm supposed to do.

162
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:06,879
Mom.

163
00:11:06,879 --> 00:11:12,083
Is this what you've been up to? Suit is your last card.

164
00:11:12,083 --> 00:11:14,420
- Let's go.
- I got sued.

165
00:11:14,420 --> 00:11:15,213
What are you talking about?

166
00:11:15,213 --> 00:11:18,350
I got a divorce suit from him.

167
00:11:20,873 --> 00:11:24,197
No way. He can't do that!

168
00:11:24,197 --> 00:11:27,405
He stabbed you in the back!

169
00:11:27,405 --> 00:11:28,811
What have you been doing while he did that?

170
00:11:28,811 --> 00:11:31,780
I sued him first. I seized his property provisionally.

171
00:11:31,780 --> 00:11:35,313
- And?
- Miss. Calm down and have a seat.

172
00:11:35,313 --> 00:11:39,278
Why did you get sued?
You sued him first!

173
00:11:39,278 --> 00:11:40,382
What's going on?

174
00:11:40,382 --> 00:11:44,492
It's nothing serious.
We can bring a counteraction.

175
00:11:44,492 --> 00:11:48,229
- What does that mean?
- We're going to bring a divorce suit too.

176
00:11:48,229 --> 00:11:50,910
Saying it's her fault, it's his fault.

177
00:11:50,910 --> 00:11:52,825
Why didn't you do that earlier?

178
00:11:52,825 --> 00:11:57,012
They acted fast. As you know, I have many clients now.

179
00:11:57,012 --> 00:12:00,977
I can't just focus on this unless you pay me more.

180
00:12:01,965 --> 00:12:05,647
You need to pay me more since your husband's properties are this much.

181
00:12:05,647 --> 00:12:10,704
Didn't you hear from your worker here that he pocketed his cast assets?

182
00:12:10,704 --> 00:12:13,936
Don't worry. This kind of case isn't the first time for me.

183
00:12:14,670 --> 00:12:16,527
I'll get it back to you.

184
00:12:16,527 --> 00:12:21,180
Don't just say, 'don't worry'. Tell me what you're going to do.

185
00:12:21,180 --> 00:12:23,274
We'll bring a counteraction and set up the court date.

186
00:12:23,274 --> 00:12:26,316
And you're going to say, 'it's not fair. it's not my fault' to the judge.

187
00:12:26,316 --> 00:12:29,229
That's the process not the plan.

188
00:12:29,229 --> 00:12:32,048
I will do it. Just leave it up to me. You talk too much.

189
00:12:33,119 --> 00:12:35,712
It's me who knows about the law among you guys.

190
00:12:35,712 --> 00:12:37,698
Just follow me!

191
00:12:39,122 --> 00:12:41,761
You have a phone call to answer.

192
00:12:47,766 --> 00:12:51,824
He's crazy.
Why do we have to follow him?

193
00:12:51,824 --> 00:12:55,899
What he said wasn't wrong though.
He knows about the law.

194
00:12:55,899 --> 00:12:59,446
- How did you find this place?
- Through the internet.

195
00:12:59,446 --> 00:13:02,248
He isn't a good one.
He only cares about money.

196
00:13:02,248 --> 00:13:04,919
- How much did you pay him?
- 5 million won.

197
00:13:06,201 --> 00:13:10,383
How long were you going to keep it a secret? Are you an orphan? Why are you doing this alone?

198
00:13:10,383 --> 00:13:13,277
Do Hyun isn't an easy man to win!

199
00:13:13,277 --> 00:13:17,828
Oh my goodness. My two daughters didn't take after me!

200
00:13:17,828 --> 00:13:19,649
You're just like your dad!
You're too soft!

201
00:13:19,649 --> 00:13:24,764
I recorded what he said about the affair.
I was only going to scare him and let him go.

202
00:13:29,208 --> 00:13:32,911
He has to go to the court.
Let me talk to you.

203
00:13:35,059 --> 00:13:37,163
We're going to prepare the counteraction and send it to the court.

204
00:13:37,163 --> 00:13:39,055
When the date is set, you will go there.

205
00:13:39,055 --> 00:13:41,445
- Give us the money back.
- What?

206
00:13:41,445 --> 00:13:44,896
You guys work so carelessly.
We can't work with you guys.

207
00:13:44,896 --> 00:13:50,547
We can't refund the money. What you said is very subjective.

208
00:13:50,741 --> 00:13:54,001
What a good speaker here.

209
00:13:54,001 --> 00:13:56,937
If you keep working like this, we can't work with you. Give us the money back.

210
00:13:56,937 --> 00:14:01,194
That's what the law says. If you want the money back, you have to sue us.

211
00:14:01,194 --> 00:14:03,054
Are you going to do it?

212
00:14:07,980 --> 00:14:10,388
Are you going to go with that lawyer?

213
00:14:10,850 --> 00:14:13,348
Then what should I do? I paid him.

214
00:14:13,348 --> 00:14:18,579
That's not important. Your kid might be taken away from you.

215
00:14:33,609 --> 00:14:35,318
What's wrong?

216
00:14:42,125 --> 00:14:44,561
Are you scared?

217
00:14:47,382 --> 00:14:50,288
What if that really happens to me?

218
00:14:51,034 --> 00:14:55,133
How can I live without Tae Hyun?

219
00:14:56,228 --> 00:15:01,779
Don't worry. That's not going to happen.
I'm not going to let that happen.

220
00:15:06,078 --> 00:15:09,884
It's all my fault. I shouldn't have had this marriage!

221
00:15:09,884 --> 00:15:14,628
I ruined one's family. It's all my fault.

222
00:15:42,297 --> 00:15:44,487
Are you done crying?

223
00:15:47,709 --> 00:15:51,194
There will be more days for you to cry. Don't waste your energy yet.

224
00:15:51,194 --> 00:15:53,321
We need a plan.

225
00:15:53,932 --> 00:15:56,984
I guess you're okay because you can still cry.

226
00:15:56,984 --> 00:16:00,151
You can't even cry if you're really in dismay.

227
00:16:02,363 --> 00:16:08,691
I can't drive now. Take Tae Hyun home please.

228
00:16:29,627 --> 00:16:38,378
Now that you've realized there's another life,
you don't have to rely on a man to live.

229
00:16:39,726 --> 00:16:42,215
It's not as bad as you think.

230
00:16:42,215 --> 00:16:44,350
But it isn't good either.

231
00:16:46,387 --> 00:16:52,950
Living a life isn't good or bad.

232
00:17:39,772 --> 00:17:41,325
You think I can win this?

233
00:17:41,325 --> 00:17:44,738
Be positive! You think so negatively.

234
00:17:44,738 --> 00:17:47,817
You're just like Sang Jin. No wonder why you guys dated.

235
00:17:47,817 --> 00:17:49,207
Don't talk about him.

236
00:17:49,207 --> 00:17:51,474
You're giving him a chance.
Why do you keep contacting him?

237
00:17:51,474 --> 00:17:54,550
What if Jung Hoon finds out about the
relationship you and Sang Jin had?

238
00:17:54,550 --> 00:17:55,783
It's okay.

239
00:17:55,783 --> 00:17:59,669
When he went to the army, his friends tried to hook him up with a girl. But he said no.

240
00:17:59,669 --> 00:18:02,879
He said he doesn't want to be trash.

241
00:18:02,879 --> 00:18:06,879
Love isn't logical. People break
up because of unreasonable things.

242
00:18:06,879 --> 00:18:10,056
If he's mad because of my past, I'm going to break up with him.

243
00:18:10,056 --> 00:18:12,573
I can't live with a man like him.

244
00:18:23,708 --> 00:18:25,769
Sang Jin.

245
00:18:26,802 --> 00:18:28,773
Why did you come? I'm tired.

246
00:18:28,773 --> 00:18:34,290
You should eat though. Let's eat.
You will study better if you get some fresh air.

247
00:18:36,180 --> 00:18:38,162
Did you make jab chae?

248
00:18:41,483 --> 00:18:44,556
- You're bothering me.
- I'm sorry.

249
00:18:52,714 --> 00:18:54,099
Eat.

250
00:18:54,099 --> 00:18:58,746
- I woke up in the morning and made all this.
- I'm eating this because of your sincerity.

251
00:18:58,746 --> 00:19:01,195
Please eat.

252
00:19:03,767 --> 00:19:05,320
How is it?

253
00:19:06,097 --> 00:19:08,482
A little bit salty.

254
00:19:27,588 --> 00:19:30,084
Here. It's some snacks and underwear.

255
00:19:30,084 --> 00:19:33,639
I'm sorry for making you do all of this.
I'll pay you if I pass the bar exam.

256
00:19:33,639 --> 00:19:37,936
Don't say that. I'm not doing this to get paid. I'm doing this because I love you.

257
00:19:37,936 --> 00:19:40,774
- Give me your hand.
- Why?

258
00:19:42,846 --> 00:19:44,693
What's that? I'm a man.

259
00:19:44,693 --> 00:19:47,727
It's a lucky charm. You should
wear this when you take the exam.

260
00:19:47,727 --> 00:19:51,402
- It's so embarrassing for a man to wear this.
- No, you can't take it off.

261
00:19:52,650 --> 00:19:55,387
If I didn't pass the exam with this, you have to take the responsibility for me.

262
00:19:55,387 --> 00:19:58,224
Okay. I will.

263
00:19:58,224 --> 00:20:00,573
Now, go study.

264
00:20:00,992 --> 00:20:01,943
Are you just going to leave?

265
00:20:01,943 --> 00:20:04,784
I hate to leave but you can't hang out with me now.

266
00:20:05,619 --> 00:20:08,133
I can have some spare time.

267
00:20:10,327 --> 00:20:13,896
Let's go somewhere so only two of us can be together.

268
00:20:26,635 --> 00:20:28,722
Don't call me again.

269
00:20:28,722 --> 00:20:30,181
Then can I visit you or text you?

270
00:20:30,181 --> 00:20:32,502
No, you can't. Just don't contact me.

271
00:20:32,502 --> 00:20:35,651
Did your boyfriend tell you not to contact me?
Tell him I'm just your friend.

272
00:20:35,651 --> 00:20:37,627
- I did.
- And he's still mad?

273
00:20:37,627 --> 00:20:40,238
He's so sulky.
A sulky man isn't good.

274
00:20:40,238 --> 00:20:43,453
I want to be sullen. That's why I'm getting married.
I need the one and only man for me.

275
00:20:43,453 --> 00:20:44,564
So nobody can touch me.

276
00:20:44,564 --> 00:20:45,942
That doesn't mean men can't touch you.

277
00:20:45,942 --> 00:20:48,454
Our country is known as a republic of affairs.

278
00:20:48,454 --> 00:20:50,739
You don't know how many people come for
a divorce suit because of an affair.

279
00:20:50,739 --> 00:20:52,871
You're so judgmental.

280
00:20:52,871 --> 00:20:54,489
Just because there are so many patients in a hospital,

281
00:20:54,489 --> 00:20:57,024
doesn't mean the country is a republic of patients.

282
00:20:57,024 --> 00:21:01,749
I love him. I don't want to do what he doesn't like.

283
00:21:02,640 --> 00:21:05,647
I also had that love from you a long time ago.

284
00:21:05,647 --> 00:21:07,664
But we can't boil up some ramen and love again.

285
00:21:07,664 --> 00:21:10,648
Okay. I'll go away so it doesn't bother your boyfriend.

286
00:21:11,124 --> 00:21:13,596
- Hope you're happy.
- You too.

287
00:21:13,596 --> 00:21:16,168
Don't drink too much.

288
00:21:16,168 --> 00:21:19,190
The most regretful thing I did in my life was leaving you.

289
00:21:19,722 --> 00:21:21,478
You surely know women well.

290
00:21:21,478 --> 00:21:26,007
What a woman wants from her ex boyfriend
is for him to regret leaving her.

291
00:21:26,007 --> 00:21:27,365
Keep that feeling in your mind.

292
00:21:27,365 --> 00:21:29,400
You're so mean.

293
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:31,720
So don't do that kind of sweet talking.

294
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:34,612
The man you're getting married with, I think he's great.

295
00:21:34,612 --> 00:21:37,006
You've become more attractive than when I was dating you.

296
00:21:37,006 --> 00:21:39,499
Don't miss him.

297
00:22:12,231 --> 00:22:13,988
I want you to stop by my house. Do you have time?

298
00:22:16,047 --> 00:22:19,120
The wedding gift...

299
00:22:56,407 --> 00:22:58,681
It looks disgusting.

300
00:22:58,681 --> 00:23:01,789
I hate getting old.

301
00:23:08,407 --> 00:23:12,165
I think I should go to a mental hospital.
Why does she look so cute to me?

302
00:23:29,996 --> 00:23:32,738
- Tae Hyun, let's get inside now.
- Tae Hyun!

303
00:23:32,738 --> 00:23:35,368
Uncle Min Ho.

304
00:23:35,368 --> 00:23:37,011
What are you doing here?

305
00:23:37,011 --> 00:23:42,510
- I slept at my grandma's house yesterday.
- I see. That's why you didn't go to daycare.

306
00:23:42,510 --> 00:23:44,992
Long time, no see, Deul Rae. Why did you eat my call?

307
00:23:44,992 --> 00:23:48,753
How can you eat a call? You just chew them?

308
00:23:48,753 --> 00:23:51,581
You use
inappropriate words in front of a kid.

309
00:23:51,581 --> 00:23:56,566
Good question. If there's anything you're
curious about, you should ask people.

310
00:23:56,566 --> 00:24:02,551
Eating a call doesn't really mean you're
eating it. It means ignoring the phone.

311
00:24:02,960 --> 00:24:05,740
Yeah, that's what it means.

312
00:24:05,740 --> 00:24:07,940
Let's go, Tae Hyun. Let's go read a book.

313
00:24:07,940 --> 00:24:13,021
- Can I ride one more slide?
- Sure. Go ahead.

314
00:24:15,062 --> 00:24:16,971
Aren't you going to ask me why I came here?

315
00:24:16,971 --> 00:24:20,864
Why do I have to? What you say is all crap.
Why do I have to listen to that?

316
00:24:20,864 --> 00:24:22,103
Why are you so stuck-up?

317
00:24:22,103 --> 00:24:24,821
Your age, look, and body are below standard.

318
00:24:25,617 --> 00:24:31,198
And you know I don't have feelings for you.
Who likes a 50 year old woman like you?

319
00:24:31,198 --> 00:24:34,279
You think a 50 year old woman
doesn't have romance or dreams?

320
00:24:34,279 --> 00:24:38,154
Kissing a person like you made me shudder.

321
00:24:38,154 --> 00:24:42,502
Do you know how bad it feels to
kiss someone I don't even love?

322
00:24:42,502 --> 00:24:47,711
Of course, you don't. You classify women by their age.
You don't know about sadness and suffering.

323
00:24:47,711 --> 00:24:50,248
You only care about how you feel.

324
00:24:50,248 --> 00:24:52,793
- Deul Rae.
- Don't ever show yourself to me.

325
00:24:52,793 --> 00:24:57,502
If you do, I'm going to break your
legs so you can't ride the motorcycle.

326
00:24:58,649 --> 00:25:01,603
Tae Hyun, let's go.

327
00:25:10,921 --> 00:25:12,709
Be careful!

328
00:25:15,730 --> 00:25:18,730
Oh my God!

329
00:25:20,847 --> 00:25:24,120
Hey, you should've been more careful!
I warned you over there!

330
00:25:26,813 --> 00:25:28,099
I'm sorry.

331
00:25:28,099 --> 00:25:30,487
You can't even park. Why do you drive?

332
00:25:31,101 --> 00:25:34,774
I know it's my fault but
part of this is your fault too.

333
00:25:34,774 --> 00:25:38,745
If you came to deliver, you should've done
it fast and left. Why did you park here?

334
00:25:38,745 --> 00:25:42,730
I was going to leave. And you can
just say sorry. Nothing else.

335
00:25:42,730 --> 00:25:45,654
Don't talk back at me. You talk too much.

336
00:25:46,705 --> 00:25:49,809
You're kind of rude to people older than you.

337
00:25:49,809 --> 00:25:53,235
You're very sensitive.
It's you who did this to my motorcycle.

338
00:25:53,235 --> 00:25:58,286
Oh my God. Today is not my day.
Why is this shitty thing happening to me today?

339
00:25:58,364 --> 00:26:00,484
What did you say?
Shitty thing?

340
00:26:00,484 --> 00:26:02,878
I'm not in a good mood either.

341
00:26:02,878 --> 00:26:09,385
I'm talking about this accident. Not you! Why
are all bad things happening to me today?

342
00:26:09,385 --> 00:26:15,249
The most difficult person to deal with
is the one who has an inferiority complex.

343
00:26:15,249 --> 00:26:18,500
You know what? You can't buy this motorcycle even if you sell that car!

344
00:26:18,500 --> 00:26:22,869
- Do you know how much this is?
- Hey, sis, what's wrong?

345
00:26:22,869 --> 00:26:25,616
Sis? Then she's Do Hyun's mother in law?

346
00:26:25,616 --> 00:26:29,688
Hey, I kind of hit his bike when I parked the car...

347
00:26:29,688 --> 00:26:34,251
- Where did he go? He was right there.
- Why did you drive Hae Jin's car?

348
00:26:45,931 --> 00:26:49,380
- He'll be done in a minute.
- Okay.

349
00:27:04,974 --> 00:27:07,918
- Do Hyun is here, right?
- Wait. You can't see him now.

350
00:27:07,918 --> 00:27:09,587
- Why?
- His wife is here.

351
00:27:09,587 --> 00:27:12,116
- Their relationship hasn't been good recently.
- I know.

352
00:27:12,116 --> 00:27:15,156
You do? I heard they're getting a divorce.
Is that true?

353
00:27:15,156 --> 00:27:17,433
- They are?
- You said you knew.

354
00:27:17,433 --> 00:27:24,108
Of course, I do. It's hard for him to live
with the same woman for a long time, you know?

355
00:27:25,774 --> 00:27:27,979
I'm going to leave.
I hate when things are serious.

356
00:27:27,979 --> 00:27:30,146
- Bye.
- Bye.

357
00:27:33,968 --> 00:27:39,133
I got the divorce suit. You were
planning to fight with me behind.

358
00:27:39,133 --> 00:27:41,756
I wanted you to be surprised.
Were you surprised?

359
00:27:41,756 --> 00:27:44,587
No. That was so you.

360
00:27:46,278 --> 00:27:50,213
What a liar. The reasons that are
on paper don't even make sense.

361
00:27:51,171 --> 00:27:52,901
I'm going to tell people who
you really are in court.

362
00:27:52,901 --> 00:27:54,721
It won't be that easy.

363
00:27:55,883 --> 00:27:58,412
Let me show you this.

364
00:27:58,412 --> 00:28:06,799
This shows what you bought for yourself
with my money. This will be evidence.

365
00:28:07,862 --> 00:28:10,214
Only the two of us know the truth.

366
00:28:10,214 --> 00:28:14,488
Others will judge our relationship by this kind of evidence.

367
00:28:14,488 --> 00:28:18,668
So even if we get a divorce, I'm
not going to lose that easily.

368
00:28:20,737 --> 00:28:25,976
You can give up now. Besides, I
have the best lawyer in Korea.

369
00:28:34,567 --> 00:28:41,105
I didn't know you have this in the house.
The view looks so different from here.

370
00:28:41,105 --> 00:28:43,462
- It's not like we live in a city, is it?
- Yeah.

371
00:28:43,462 --> 00:28:45,476
This is why I like this house.

372
00:28:45,476 --> 00:28:51,974
And about the house, we've decided to let
you live in the apartment right away.

373
00:28:51,974 --> 00:28:53,294
We're fine.

374
00:28:53,294 --> 00:28:56,865
Your father in law wants you to live in a
comfortable apartment rather than a studio.

375
00:28:56,865 --> 00:28:59,707
- You have a nice father in law.
- I know.

376
00:28:59,707 --> 00:29:04,163
I'm working on the list of wedding
gifts that you wrote for me.

377
00:29:04,163 --> 00:29:08,537
I'm working on the list of wedding
gifts that you wrote for me.

378
00:29:08,537 --> 00:29:11,215
- I heard you met Chae Young.
- Yeah.

379
00:29:11,215 --> 00:29:15,075
My sister called me and she wants
you to apologize to Chae Young.

380
00:29:15,075 --> 00:29:17,666
Men are blind in their own causes.
I'm on your side.

381
00:29:18,370 --> 00:29:21,654
Don't apologize to her. How dare she tells
everything to my sister already?

382
00:29:21,654 --> 00:29:26,669
She should've let you guys work it out.
Don't apologize to her, okay?

383
00:29:26,669 --> 00:29:29,040
I'll apologize to her, Mrs. Hae.

384
00:29:30,018 --> 00:29:32,900
- Did you know it was irony?
- Yeah.

385
00:29:32,900 --> 00:29:37,525
I'm glad you figured it out.
You're a better person than Chae Young.

386
00:29:37,525 --> 00:29:42,088
Is there any way that I can show
how good you are to my sister?

387
00:29:56,048 --> 00:29:57,515
The boss is doing this kind of stuff too?

388
00:29:57,977 --> 00:30:01,904
This is the most important thing.
The management.

389
00:30:01,904 --> 00:30:04,496
- Give me Chae Young's number.
- Why?

390
00:30:04,496 --> 00:30:07,977
Mrs. Hae told me to apologize to her.
Your mother called Mrs. Hae.

391
00:30:07,977 --> 00:30:09,174
So are you really going to do it?

392
00:30:09,174 --> 00:30:11,958
I don't want to do it and there isn't
anything I did wrong but I'm going to.

393
00:30:11,958 --> 00:30:14,530
That's what she wants.

394
00:30:14,530 --> 00:30:17,418
This is a new you.
You have changed.

395
00:30:18,677 --> 00:30:20,620
Are you doing good with Chae Young?

396
00:30:21,645 --> 00:30:26,037
Thanks for not asking me if I love her.

397
00:30:26,037 --> 00:30:27,570
We're good.

398
00:30:27,570 --> 00:30:30,835
But if I think of Dong Bi, I hate you.

399
00:30:30,835 --> 00:30:33,460
A marriage isn't the final destination of love.

400
00:30:34,191 --> 00:30:37,413
I can love Dong Bi more because I didn't get married with her.

401
00:30:37,413 --> 00:30:40,152
What is this crap you're spewing?

402
00:30:40,152 --> 00:30:42,131
Crap? Lap? Map?

403
00:30:42,131 --> 00:30:44,909
It's not funny.

404
00:30:45,870 --> 00:30:50,639
Be good to Jung Hoon. I saw him in the
morning and he looked so worried.

405
00:30:50,639 --> 00:30:54,265
- Why?
- You two should talk.

406
00:31:06,944 --> 00:31:08,584
What is it?

407
00:31:08,584 --> 00:31:11,180
Why do you ask me what I'm doing?

408
00:31:11,180 --> 00:31:13,958
Are you that bored? Why do you keep calling me?

409
00:31:15,143 --> 00:31:17,625
Hello?

410
00:31:18,122 --> 00:31:20,345
Did he hang up?

411
00:31:21,580 --> 00:31:24,289
Are you crying?
Why?

412
00:31:25,260 --> 00:31:27,625
There's nothing you can cry about.
You have everything.

413
00:31:29,131 --> 00:31:30,898
Turn the music down. It's so loud.

414
00:31:31,834 --> 00:31:35,129
Son of the richest man in Busan.

415
00:31:35,129 --> 00:31:37,253
Don't call me unless it's important.

416
00:31:37,253 --> 00:31:40,651
I have to make money to live since
I don't have a rich father like you.

417
00:31:43,254 --> 00:31:47,064
He just hung up on me?
What a bad bastard.

418
00:31:49,260 --> 00:31:52,442
There isn't a lawyer in our whole family.

419
00:31:53,164 --> 00:31:56,948
Who should I ask for?
Is there anybody that might know one of them?

420
00:31:57,458 --> 00:32:00,831
There is. Should I call him?

421
00:32:00,831 --> 00:32:04,060
No. If Hae Yoon finds out, she's going to freak out.

422
00:32:04,060 --> 00:32:07,904
But it's an emergency.
That's not important now.

423
00:32:14,670 --> 00:32:17,033
- Hi, Mrs. Jung.
- Hey, how are you?

424
00:32:17,033 --> 00:32:20,111
Yeah. I heard you're sick. Are you okay?

425
00:32:20,111 --> 00:32:24,567
Yeah. I'm all better. I called you to ask you something.

426
00:32:24,567 --> 00:32:27,505
Do you know any lawyers?

427
00:32:28,532 --> 00:32:29,610
Why do you need a lawyer?

428
00:32:29,610 --> 00:32:32,814
One of my friends needs a lawyer.

429
00:32:32,814 --> 00:32:37,190
I thought you or your parents would know a good lawyer.

430
00:32:37,190 --> 00:32:40,497
Well... I don't know any specific lawyers.

431
00:32:40,497 --> 00:32:45,462
Wouldn't Do Hyun know some?
He might know some of them.

432
00:32:45,462 --> 00:32:48,793
It's okay.
Thanks anyway.

433
00:32:50,402 --> 00:32:54,641
Do Hyun's probably good at that
since he has done it once before.

434
00:32:55,872 --> 00:32:57,941
What should I do?

435
00:32:59,730 --> 00:33:03,157
I guess she doesn't know
about Jun Sang Jin.

436
00:33:03,157 --> 00:33:06,475
He wasn't that big of a part
of her past.

437
00:33:08,233 --> 00:33:15,067
I feel so bad. There isn't anyone that might
know some good lawyers around me.

438
00:33:16,554 --> 00:33:19,186
Hae Yoon probably doesn't know anyone.

439
00:33:19,186 --> 00:33:21,233
Would Dong Bi know?

440
00:33:23,096 --> 00:33:24,975
- Who is he?
- Mom.

441
00:33:24,975 --> 00:33:28,056
- Hi, Mrs. Hae.
- He's a lawyer.

442
00:33:28,786 --> 00:33:33,522
That's it! Why haven't I thought of that?

443
00:33:36,774 --> 00:33:38,852
Money isn't everything.

444
00:33:41,708 --> 00:33:43,502
Why am I writing this?

445
00:33:45,105 --> 00:33:47,185
I'm telling you this because I care about you.

446
00:33:47,185 --> 00:33:49,949
Do you think this would be the last time you ask for money?

447
00:33:49,949 --> 00:33:52,164
Damn it! I'm not going to talk to you ever again!

448
00:33:52,164 --> 00:33:54,483
Damn it! I'm not going to talk to you ever again!

449
00:33:55,863 --> 00:33:57,595
Why do you live like that?

450
00:33:57,595 --> 00:33:59,174
Why do you live like that?

451
00:33:59,174 --> 00:34:02,050
It's not good for you if you
get so crazy about money.

452
00:34:02,050 --> 00:34:04,432
It's not good for you if you get so crazy about money.

453
00:34:14,093 --> 00:34:18,132
Life is hard and so is marriage.

454
00:34:19,052 --> 00:34:23,780
I think we just have to love and
live happily but living is hard.

455
00:34:24,367 --> 00:34:28,093
- I'll be here next to you.
- Hae Yoon.

456
00:34:28,804 --> 00:34:30,434
What's so hard for you?

457
00:34:30,434 --> 00:34:33,578
I didn't know how hard it is to take
responsibility for one person.

458
00:34:34,991 --> 00:34:37,352
Have some. I bought them on the way.

459
00:34:38,014 --> 00:34:40,020
It could've been so much better
if you had made all of this.

460
00:34:40,391 --> 00:34:43,093
Then just think I made them all.

461
00:34:43,093 --> 00:34:47,870
Okay. This is what Hae Yoon made for me!

462
00:34:51,545 --> 00:34:54,489
- When are you going to be done?
- It'll take a while to write about this.

463
00:34:55,274 --> 00:34:57,563
I will help you. I have to write about this toy?

464
00:34:58,335 --> 00:35:01,495
Please listen to me, you stupid!

465
00:35:01,495 --> 00:35:03,082
It's so cute.

466
00:35:03,519 --> 00:35:06,455
Are you going to keep doing this?

467
00:35:07,112 --> 00:35:09,995
